        <text><![CDATA[This repeats the number of weeks instead of dividing growth by weeks.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>MCR_U01_L06_Q07</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> MCR_U01_L06_Q07</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.MCR.QR.6</p><p>A water tank has 50 gallons at minute 2 and 90 gallons at minute 10. What is the average rate of change?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[40 gallons per minute]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This is the total change in gallons, not divided by time.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[8 gallons per minute]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This is the time interval, not the rate.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[5 gallons per minute]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Correct. The tank gains 40 gallons over 8 minutes, so 40 divided by 8 = 5.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[140 gallons per minute]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This adds the amounts and ignores the interval.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>MCR_U01_L06_Q08</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> MCR_U01_L06_Q08</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.MCR.QR.6</p><p>Which formula represents average rate of change?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[input change divided by output change]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[This reverses the rate. Rate of change uses output change over input change.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[output plus input]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Adding does not compare changes over an interval.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[total output only]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[The rate needs both output change and input change.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[change in output divided by change in input]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Correct. Average rate of change compares output change to input change.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
