      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> MCR_U01_L06_Q16</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.MCR.QR.6</p><p>A temperature changes from 72 degrees to 60 degrees over 4 hours. What is the average rate of change?</p>]]></text>
